{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_09_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:aaa4280ae5ca9ee3ed0fbdf6ef4cfd52b40e282710f308892cc917d33fa12100",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e7409a89b293cf18f9b9adfcb4e4b974a313fa3527a643d73241604c5b27acb",
      "text": "当然可以。长大后的我啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55ee88459fcfaca719e42214d91fbad501b2dffd87d87a0a690b31d1ca43ad27",
      "text": "能比你更流畅地算出更复杂的算式，\n也能解开超高难度的谜题了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff25f37a42f5eaf910f5bc1be010361e811414c4187da9a63d173f8393cec3bc",
      "text": "那么，也能像爷爷和爸爸一样，\n成为优秀的学校老师吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e81bcecb6a1e6499b240b53c7a5c22bcad1df30fa415c85f7009f1ebc85cc07",
      "text": "嗯。\n……但是，你并不会一直待在学校里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b175463312f48103dd382705f243349d206b17d3354677e1b407460111c819ce",
      "text": "你会在另一个地方，与同伴们一起，\n教导许许多多的年轻人，实现梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1678924a0c263a67bbce5c0af78bad9d0229201690be5a9a86f81c7f2b50a1f",
      "text": "不仅运用学到的知识，还会借助歌声与舞蹈……\n讲授数学、英语，还有化学。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f910a25b9ca3430809ae29d86298e26b2801d5cffa8b9d1cc981977e4da0538",
      "text": "好厉害，能做的事情好多啊！\n可是，长大后的我，为什么穿着那样的衣服呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d26fab51ce93894aa4077fb0b2a87ff660101f7ad8e9f7295314aa2f991baaa1",
      "text": "唔。这身装束是……咳咳。\n对我来说，也着实是非常出乎意料。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09717561a053685b4b5b22a65a5c1552a6612026e3dad25bbe9b353eb95835e4",
      "text": "请抱有自信，今后继续向前迈进吧。\n你的努力，必定会开花结果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000098:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a740d899e21a61a26cfed617310daa45603a2269ebfcda92e0bbac8be60b1dd9",
      "text": "“拍摄工作顺利结束啦”……\n好，给●●●●プロデューサー酱的联络完毕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cd88a0b755ec1f792bb135e64a13ee1cf8a3251c77a39c617d00b842d5984b9",
      "text": "……硲先生今天也待在那个地方吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ce90875c2663ae3c346ff818e9f2487c345a4c84926d3ee2a0faea534e99fce",
      "text": "果然在这里。\n硲先生。这次的事，真的很遗憾呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ad1bd9423caada48c3e98051f0e6654a023eecbd6c4e0a237e6cd3452bf2414",
      "text": "没想到男极联赛和知识部门，\n居然会以这种形式突然结束。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
